        "contract": "sdlc-ai-spec/skill-command-result/v1",
        "display": "sdlc-500-vfy 0.3.0\n\nUsage: /sdlc-500-vfy [command] [options] [-- request text]\n\nCommands:\n  auto       根据准确 Scope、当前 Subject Set 和已有 VFY 状态选择 create、run、revise 或 check。\n  create     从 repeatable exact input 编译 VFY Contract，并执行当前安全可执行 Method。\n  run        执行或记录当前 open Revision 中选定的 pending Method。\n  revise     基于新的权威 Subject 或 Control Input 创建新 Revision；无变化返回 NO_CHANGE。\n  check      从准确持久化 Reference 绝对只读复核 Scope、Subject、Evidence、Return 与 Gate。\n  help       显示用途、参数和副作用边界。\n  version    显示 Skill 与接口版本。\n  commands   列出全部命令及是否写入。\n  examples   显示准确 Reference 与 Method 选择示例。\n\nCommon options:\n  -h, --help\n  -V, --version\n      --commands\n      --examples\n  -o, --operation VALUE\n  -p, --project-root PATH\n  -r, --reference REF\n  -d, --decision-policy user|model|experiment\n  -w, --write-policy auto|confirm|deny\n  -n, --dry-run\n  -f, --output summary|json|debug\n\nVFY options:\n  -i, --input REF    repeatable exact Scope/Subject/Control/Exception input\n  -r, --reference REF exact persisted VFY Revision for run/revise/check\n  -m, --method VFM-NNN repeatable selected Method for run\n      persistent create/revise compiles Authority from --input\n",
        "effects": [],
        "ok": true,
        "state": "meta"
      },
      "status": "PASS"
    },
